  "summary": {
    "pt": [
      "O Rei de Paus fala de vontade, liderança e honestidade.",
      "Ele representa o fogo transformado em projetos que duram.",
      "O foco dele é: agir com metas que sejam de fato suas."
    ],
    "en": [
      "The King of Wands speaks of will, leadership and honesty.",
      "He stands for fire turned into projects that last.",
      "His focus: acting on goals that are truly his own."
    ]
  },
